{"type":"message","id":"952f8742","parentId":"28694aa4","timestamp":"2026-02-27T08:36:50.431Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，函数看起来正确。但是我发现一个问题：当卡片已经显示答案时，翻转回去不应该隐藏评分按钮，因为用户可能还想评分。让我重新思考这个逻辑。\n\n实际上，根据 Anki 的工作流程：\n1. 显示问题\n2. 点击卡片或按空格显示答案\n3. 显示评分按钮\n4. 选择评分\n5. 下一张卡片\n\n所以卡片翻转只是为了视觉效果，真正的流程是：\n- 点击卡片 → 显示答案 → 显示评分按钮\n- 不应该有\"翻转回去\"的功能，因为一旦显示答案，用户就应该评分\n\n让我修正 toggleCardFlip 函数，使其只在未显示答案时翻转。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f7bbd12bb6d442f3812a3463","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/one/.openclaw/skills/fsrs-memory/web/public && cat > fix_toggle.js << 'ENDSCRIPT'\nconst fs = require('fs');\nlet content = fs.readFileSync('app.js', 'utf8');\n\nconst oldToggle = `function toggleCardFlip() {\n  const cardArea = document.getElementById('card-flip-area');\n  const cardInner = cardArea?.querySelector('.card-inner');\n  \n  if (!cardInner) return;\n  \n  if (!isAnswerShown) {\n    // Flip to show answer\n    showAnswer();\n    cardArea.classList.add('card-flipped');\n  } else {\n    // Flip back to question\n    cardArea.classList.remove('card-flipped');\n    isAnswerShown = false;\n    document.getElementById('rating-buttons').style.display = 'none';\n  }\n}`;\n\nconst newToggle = `function toggleCardFlip() {\n  const cardArea = document.getElementById('card-flip-area');\n  if (!cardArea) return;\n  \n  if (!isAnswerShown) {\n    // Flip to show answer\n    showAnswer();\n    cardArea.classList.add('card-flipped');\n  }\n  // Once answer is shown, don't flip back - user should rate the card\n}`;\n\ncontent = content.replace(oldToggle, newToggle);\nfs.writeFileSync('app.js', content);\nconsole.log('Fixed!');\nENDSCRIPT\nnode fix_toggle.js && rm fix_toggle.js"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"qwen3.5-plus","usage":{"input":145258,"output":633,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":145891,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"tot